<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 287.5 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 287.5 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 287.5 million dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank all-Maghrib (Central Bank) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Rates were unchanged and bids (million dirhams) accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY     BID    AMOUNT	 INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    52 weeks	25	25	     nine percent</p>
<p>    Five years    87.5    87.5	   10 percent</p>
<p>    10 years     100     100	     10.25</p>
<p>    15 years	75	75	     10.50</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	  287.5   287.5</p>
<p>($1 =8.7 dirhams)</p>
<p>-- Rabat newsroom (212-7) 726518</p>
</text>
